  <a class="infobox" href="#">
    <div class="heading">Farm-to-table listicle</div>
    <div class="description">
      Direct trade mixtape, forage sriracha chambray gluten-free viral marfa.
    </div>
  </a>

  <ul class="infobox">
    <li><a href="#">Tousled portland distillery</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Ethical migas small batch</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Woke selvage forage</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Menu</h2>

  <section class="menu">
    <a href="#">Single-origin</a>
    <a href="#">Cold-pressed</a>
    <a href="#">Direct trade</a>
    <a href="#">Small batch</a>
    <a href="#">Woke selvage</a>
  </section>

  <h2>Buttons</h2>

  <p>
    <a class="button" href="#">Brew a batch &rarr;</a>{" "}
    <a class="button" data-size="small" href="#">Small batch</a>
  </p>

  <ul class="inline-menu">
    <li><a href="#">Forage</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Direct trade</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Gluten-free</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Viral</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Media</h2>

  <p>
    Artisan kombucha tote bag single-origin coffee, before they sold out
    cold-pressed meditation retreat. Farm-to-table listicle direct trade
    mixtape, forage sriracha chambray gluten-free viral marfa. Tousled portland
    distillery, ethical migas small batch woke selvage.
  </p>

  <div class="photo-grid paragraph">
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/art/assets/2025-04-13-dedenne.webp"
        alt="Dedenne"
        width="2048"
        height="2048"
      />
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/art/assets/2020-06-14-teeny-sanguini.webp"
        alt="Teeny Sanguini"
        width="1280"
        height="1280"
      />
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <img
