    </figure>
  </div>

  <h2>Divider</h2>

  <p><strong>Above the line:</strong> artisan kombucha tote bag.</p>

  <hr />

  <p>
    <strong>Below the line:</strong> single-origin coffee, before they sold out.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
